      <div class="card">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="this.classList.toggle('open')">
          <div class="q">忘記電腦或信箱密碼怎麼辦？<svg class="arw" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg></div>
